[FILE]

Replay a deterministic, append-only event log and print the resulting
kernel state. Reads from FILE, or stdin if no FILE given.

Event format (one per line):
  POP <id>
  MERGE <a> <b>
  LINK <a> <b> <type>
  UNLINK <a> <b> <type>
  COLLAPSE <id...> -> <representative>
  SETMETA <id> <key> <value>

Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
